<title>UK: Siam City Bank sets $115 mln 5-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Siam City Bank sets $115 mln 5-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager J.P. Morgan Securities.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SIAM CITY BANK PLC</p>
<p> AMT    $115 MLN	COUPON     7.375     MATURITY    25.SEP.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.474    PAY DATE    25.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  50 BP     REOFFER    99.474    SPREAD	+100 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	BBA2	LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    25 BP     SELL CONC  25 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND FIVE-YAR U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF GLOBAL MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
